      <title>Version 2.1.7</title>
      <sparkle:version>47</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.1.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <link>https://github.com/andrew-waters/orchard/releases/tag/v2.1.7</link>
      <description><![CDATA[
<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul>
<li>Orchard now links the Apple container 1.2.2 client libraries (previously 1.1.0), restoring compatibility with current container installs (<a href="https://github.com/andrew-waters/orchard/issues/54">#54</a>).</li>
<li>When the installed container release doesn&#x27;t match the client Orchard links, the app now shows the version-incompatibility screen with upgrade guidance instead of reporting the system as stopped with a raw health-check decode error (<a href="https://github.com/andrew-waters/orchard/issues/37">#37</a>, <a href="https://github.com/andrew-waters/orchard/issues/39">#39</a>).</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
